<title>ETHIOPIA: Ethiopia tenders $60.6 million in T-bills.</title>
<headline>Ethiopia tenders $60.6 million in T-bills.</headline>
<dateline>ADDIS ABABA 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The central National Bank of Ethiopia (NBE) on Wednesday tendered for sale treasury bills valued at 400 million birr ($60.6 million).</p>
<p>The bills are for the 28-day, 91-day and 182-day categories and are to be issued on 7 May 1997.</p>
<p>The amounts tendered were 200 million birr for 28-day bills maturing on 4 June, 150 million birr for 91-day bills maturing on 6 August and 50 million birr for 182-day bill maturing on November 6.</p>
<p>($1=6.6040 birr)</p>
<p>--T Tadesse, Addis Ababa ++2511-511058.</p>
